{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は生ドルです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\nアップアップガールズ(仮)さんと\nまねきケチャさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お二組ともお久しぶりなので\n前回よりも楽しくてできたらいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016/09/29(木) 20:00開始\nhttp://live.nicovideo.jp/watch/lv276543546"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20時からで少し早いから\n観られなそうな方はタイムシフトを忘れずにね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブが終わってからも\nちゃんと毎日、お仕事だよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい事だね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中でも\nスイーツはちゃんと食べてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔法の国のアリス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クレームブリュレ～魔法の国の時計仕掛け～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリスレストラン系列は\nスイーツだけじゃなくて\nランチとかでもちょくちょく行くけど\nやっぱり見た目の可愛さね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物って\nというか特にスイーツは\n見た目かなり大事だからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メニューのネーミングもすごいし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『チェシャ猫のハートスマイル』とか\n『ホワイトラビットの懐中時計』\nってメニューがあったりするわけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう説明なしじゃ何かわからない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれでワイワイしながら\nみんなで食べるのいいなーと思うんですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、初めてのデートとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張して喋れない、しかし\n「このメニューなに～？可愛い～！」\n的な話題がうまれる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妄想ふくらむ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/29/7736241/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}